MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- New mobile/ Expo SDK 57 app with Expo Router, NativeWind and the same
  design (themes Ocean/Sunset/Lime/Grape, tabs Heute/Übungen/Profil/Settings)
- Native Firebase (Auth: email, Google, phone; Firestore userProgress sync)
- In-app account deletion and privacy policy, no ads/tracking
- Offline packs bundled from public/packs via scripts/generate-mobile-packs.mjs
- Extract framework-free learning-history and progress-document helpers
  into app/lib so web and native share them

